<title>LUXEMBOURG: Cargolux Jan 1997 traffic up 15pct.</title>
<headline>Cargolux Jan 1997 traffic up 15pct.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargolux Airlines International said it flew 159.9 million freight tonne kilometres, FTK, in January 1997, up 15 percent on the same month the previous year.</p>
<p>Cargolux operates a fleet of  three Boeing 747-400F's and is to take delivery of a further two 400F's later this year.</p>
<p>The Luxembourg-based cargo airline also operates four Boeing 747-200F's, including one on leaseback. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
